  m_text: "A small, round-capped mushroom softly glowing at the edges. Its slender
    stem carries flickering specks of light.\n\nIf handled with care, a trace of
    its bioluminescence can be preserved, lending a gentle glow to any potion it\u2019s
    brewed into."
